      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMMY TARO (1) has missed the frame at his last two but did run well three back when third (18.74) in a Grade 5 at this track. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. SKYLIFT (2) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Grade 5 at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. MANTON ROAD (3) scored her maiden success two back then hit the frame last time when third and beaten 2 lengths at this track over 318m (18.46). Yet to win here but has run some good races. Hard to beat again here. KARINYA SHALL BE (5) has been freshened and can sneak into the frame on her best form.",
